<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Miracle | Gaming World</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  background: #070711;
  color: white;
}

nav {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 18px 25px;
  background: rgba(7,7,17,0.9);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  z-index: 1000;
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

.logo {
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #00e5ff;
}

nav a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-left: 18px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: #00e5ff;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 100px 20px 40px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at top, #162044, #070711 60%);
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(42px, 9vw, 80px);
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.hero h1 span {
  color: #00e5ff;
}

.hero p {
  color: #aaa;
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 14px 25px;
  background: #00e5ff;
  color: #05050b;
  border-radius: 8px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

.btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 25px #00e5ff;
}

section {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 90px 25px;
}

.title {
  text-align: center;
  color: #00e5ff;
  font-size: 35px;
  margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.about {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 750px;
  margin: auto;
  color: #bbb;
  font-size: 18px;
}

.games {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 25px;
}

.game {
  background: #11111f;
  border: 1px solid #25253c;
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 30px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  transition: 0.3s;
}

.game:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
  border-color: #00e5ff;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,229,255,0.15);
}

.game-icon {
  font-size: 55px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.game h3 {
  color: #00e5ff;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.game p {
  color: #999;
}

.stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  text-align: center;
}

.stat {
  background: #11111f;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}

.stat h3 {
  color: #00e5ff;
  font-size: 32px;
}

.stat p {
  color: #999;
}

.contact {
  text-align: center;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px;
  background: #040409;
  color: #777;
}

@media(max-width:600px) {
  nav {
    padding: 15px;
  }

  nav a {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .hero p {
    font-size: 17px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">MIRACLE 🎮</div>

  <div>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#games">Games</a>
    <a href="#stats">Stats</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div>
    <h1>I'm <span>Miracle</span> 🎮</h1>

    <p>
      Gamer • Creator • Future Legend
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="#games">
      Enter My Gaming World
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="about">

  <h2 class="title">ABOUT ME</h2>

  <p class="about">
    Welcome to my website! I'm Miracle.
    Gaming is one of the things I enjoy, and this website
    is where I can share my gaming world, favorite games,
    achievements and a little about myself.
  </p>

</section>

<section id="games">

  <h2 class="title">MY GAMES 🎮</h2>

  <div class="games">

    <div class="game">
      <div class="game-icon">⚽</div>
      <h3>Football</h3>
      <p>One of my favorite types of games.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="game">
      <div class="game-icon">🔫</div>
      <h3>Action Games</h3>
      <p>Fast action, challenges and competition.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="game">
      <div class="game-icon">🏎️</div>
      <h3>Racing</h3>
      <p>Speed, competition and winning races.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<section id="stats">

  <h2 class="title">GAMING STATS 🏆</h2>

  <div class="stats">

    <div class="stat">
      <h3>∞</h3>
      <p>Gaming Hours</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stat">
      <h3>🎮</h3>
      <p>Gamer</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stat">
      <h3>🏆</h3>
      <p>Future Wins</p>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="contact">

  <h2 class="title">THANKS FOR VISITING ❤️</h2>

  <p class="about">
    More gaming content coming soon.
  </p>

</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 Miracle | Gaming World
</footer>

</body>
</html>